window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-070-1d1ac76fb1aad2cf.json"]={sha256:"1d1ac76fb1aad2cf506182211744e710159b781f34f87bb799a792b076d5f6ac",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-13dcc36c8aa76860","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9097","title":"RFC 9097: Metrics and Methods for One-Way IP Capacity","titleEn":"RFC 9097: Metrics and Methods for One-Way IP Capacity","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-070","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-070","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-071","referenceUrls":["https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/"],"title":"Shannon AWGN 鏈路：頻寬與功率預算","titleEn":"Shannon AWGN link: bandwidth and power budgets","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受120/80 Mb/s為觀測速率；不得命名為已驗證路徑容量或線速。 交接時須能核對：交付 capacity-observations.csv、時間窗敏感度圖與單位核對。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Accept120/80 Mb/s as observed rates, not verified path capacity or line rate. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver capacity-observations.csv, window-sensitivity plots and unit checks.","difference":"能推導並解釋4000000 bit/s與2000000 bit/s，建立capacity.csv、SNR單位表、容量反算表，並完成以下驗收：第二組若需求3 Mbit/s則模型已否決；第一組僅通過必要容量檢查，仍需實測效率。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 4000000 bit/s and 2000000 bit/s; create capacity.csv, an SNR unit table and inverse-capacity checks; apply this acceptance decision: A 3 Mbit/s demand fails the second bound; the first passes only a necessary capacity check and still needs efficiency evidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["IP容量量測需明確封包層級、時間窗及方法；一段成功傳輸速率不是路徑容量的無條件證明。\n教學基準：12000000*8/0.8/1000000 = 120 Mb/s observed；對照：12000000*8/1.2/1000000 = 80 Mb/s observed。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","從原理 高斯加性白雜訊模型的容量為 B log2(1+S/N)；S/N 必須是線性比，容量上界不等於實際吞吐。 展開基準式 1000000*log2(1+15)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：把 C/B 還原為 2^(C/B)-1，分別得到15與3；另記編碼、導頻及封包開銷尚未納入。 將兩條推導一起存入 capacity.csv、SNR單位表、容量反算表。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["IP-capacity measurement requires explicit packet layer, time window and method; one successful transfer rate does not unconditionally prove path capacity.\nTeaching baseline: 12000000*8/0.8/1000000 = 120 Mb/s observed; comparison: 12000000*8/1.2/1000000 = 80 Mb/s observed. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Starting from For an AWGN channel C=B log2(1+S/N); S/N is linear and the bound is not application throughput., expand baseline expression 1000000*log2(1+15); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Invert using 2^(C/B)-1 to recover 15 and 3; coding, pilots and packet overhead are not yet included. Save both derivations with capacity.csv, an SNR unit table and inverse-capacity checks.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-080","referenceUrls":["https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/"],"title":"MIMO 奇異模態：秩與功率分配","titleEn":"MIMO singular modes: rank and power allocation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：第5項研究的可複查條件：接受120/80 Mb/s為觀測速率；不得命名為已驗證路徑容量或線速。 交接時須能核對：交付 capacity-observations.csv、時間窗敏感度圖與單位核對。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Investigation 5 review criterion: Accept120/80 Mb/s as observed rates, not verified path capacity or line rate. Handover must also reconcile: Deliver capacity-observations.csv, window-sensitivity plots and unit checks.","difference":"能推導並解釋8 bit/s/Hz與4.95419631039 bit/s/Hz，建立mimo_modes.csv、奇異值/功率表、逐模態容量，並完成以下驗收：6 bit/s/Hz的教學目標僅良好雙模態達成；實作需再扣導頻與編碼開銷。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 8 bit/s/Hz and 4.95419631039 bit/s/Hz; create mimo_modes.csv, singular-value/power table and per-mode capacity; apply this acceptance decision: Only the well-conditioned pair reaches a6 bit/s/Hz teaching target; practical overhead remains to be deducted.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["IP容量量測需明確封包層級、時間窗及方法；一段成功傳輸速率不是路徑容量的無條件證明。\n教學基準：12000000*8/0.8/1000000 = 120 Mb/s observed；對照：12000000*8/1.2/1000000 = 80 Mb/s observed。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","從原理 平行獨立模態的理想容量可相加sum log2(1+SNRi)；增加天線不保證通道滿秩，需固定總功率。 展開基準式 log2(1+15)+log2(1+15)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：分開計算每模態貢獻並驗總SNR均30；第二特徵值為零時不得仍算兩條資料流。 將兩條推導一起存入 mimo_modes.csv、奇異值/功率表、逐模態容量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["IP-capacity measurement requires explicit packet layer, time window and method; one successful transfer rate does not unconditionally prove path capacity.\nTeaching baseline: 12000000*8/0.8/1000000 = 120 Mb/s observed; comparison: 12000000*8/1.2/1000000 = 80 Mb/s observed. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Starting from Ideal independent-mode capacities add as sum log2(1+SNRi); extra antennas do not guarantee rank and total power must be fixed., expand baseline expression log2(1+15)+log2(1+15); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Calculate each mode separately and confirm total SNR30; a zero second eigenvalue cannot support a second data stream. Save both derivations with mimo_modes.csv, singular-value/power table and per-mode capacity.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-12394b4a22706b67","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-450-principles-of-digital-communications-i-fall-2006/","title":"Principles of Digital Communications I","titleEn":"Principles of Digital Communications I","publisher":"MIT OpenCourseWare","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
